{"type":"text","timestamp":1788193120645,"sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","part":{"id":"prt_0589d9e79001gOkF7Etw1X3cpX","messageID":"msg_0589d8e86001BREsMqQtx4ixi6","sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","type":"text","text":"Evidence points to an auth-gateway change causing issuer validation failures that propagate through `payment-api` into `checkout-web`; `orders-db` and `cdn-edge` look like side noise, not the checkout blocker.","time":{"start":1788193119865,"end":1788193120636},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0a9fb7b3d9fc89b0016a95a95fceb487d2ba9a66eb1655527e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
