{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788193164270,"sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_wc1fTaALxdBZjpcxKyBE7e8K","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/out/triage_notes.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Checkout Incident Triage Notes\n2: \n3: ## Summary\n4: \n5: Dependency path from user impact to root cause:\n6: \n7: `checkout-web` user submits checkout -> `payment-api` validates payment auth -> `auth-gateway` rejects partner token issuer -> `payment-api` returns 401 -> `checkout-web` checkout flow fails.\n8: \n9: ## Directly Observed Facts\n10: \n11: - `/workspace/in/topology.json` shows `checkout-web` depends on `payment-api`, and `payment-api` depends on `auth-gateway`.\n12: - `/workspace/in/topology.json` lists recent change `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway` at `2026-03-22T14:05:00Z` with summary `rotated issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation`.\n13: - `/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows `AUTH-2026-0318` deployed, then a `jwks cache lookup miss`, then `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1`.\n14: - `/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log` shows `token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway reason=issuer_not_allowed issuer=partner-v2` and then `create_payment rejected ... auth_result=invalid_issuer`.\n15: - `/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows `submit_order failed status=401 upstream=payment-api` and `payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer`.\n16: - `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows concurrent 401 spikes at `14:10:00Z` on `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway`.\n17: - `/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log` shows `p95_query_ms=35`, `errors=0`, and `no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812`.\n18: \n19: ## Inferences\n20: \n21: - The primary root cause is `auth-gateway`, not `checkout-web` or `payment-api`, because the downstream services report upstream auth rejection and the first concrete validation failure is logged inside `auth-gateway`.\n22: - The most likely bad change is `AUTH-2026-0318`, because it immediately precedes the incident window and its stated scope matches the observed issuer/JWKS mismatch.\n23: - `orders-db` is not the checkout blocker, because the failure occurs before the orders path is reached.\n24: - `cdn-edge` is not the checkout blocker, because the observed impact is authorization failure during submit, not persistent asset unavailability.\n25: \n26: ## Root Cause Statement\n27: \n28: `auth-gateway` change `AUTH-2026-0318` appears to have rotated the issuer/JWKS namespace to `partner-v2` without updating `allowed_issuers` consistently. That left validation falling back to `partner-v1`, producing `issuer_not_allowed` errors for `partner-v2` tokens and causing `payment-api` and then `checkout-web` to reject checkout requests with 401s.\n29: \n30: ## Misleading Signals Excluded\n31: \n32: - `orders-db` CPU spike: directly observed, but query latency stayed normal and no failing checkout reached the DB.\n33: - `cdn-edge` image 5xx: directly observed, but isolated to static assets and explicitly not the reason the checkout submit path remained blocked.\n34: \n35: ## Immediate Mitigation\n36: \n37: 1. Revert `AUTH-2026-0318`, or restore `auth-gateway` configuration so `allowed_issuers` includes `partner-v2` and matches the active JWKS namespace.\n38: 2. Refresh or clear the JWKS cache after the config rollback/fix to stop fallback to `partner-v1`.\n39: 3. Monitor `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway` for disappearance of `invalid issuer` and `issuer_not_allowed` errors.\n40: \n41: ## Verification Steps\n42: \n43: 1. Confirm `auth-gateway` no longer logs `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed` for `partner-v2` tokens.\n44: 2. Confirm `payment-api` stops logging `auth_result=invalid_issuer` and payment creation requests succeed.\n45: 3. Confirm `checkout-web` no longer returns `status=401 upstream=payment-api` for checkout submit requests.\n46: 4. Check that 401 rates in `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` equivalent live dashboards return near baseline for `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway`.\n47: 5. Run a partner-token checkout smoke test that exercises the exact dependency chain `checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway`.\n\n(End of file - total 47 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Checkout Incident Triage Notes\n\n## Summary\n\nDependency path from user impact to root cause:\n\n`checkout-web` user submits checkout -> `payment-api` validates payment auth -> `auth-gateway` rejects partner token issuer -> `payment-api` returns 401 -> `checkout-web` checkout flow fails.\n\n## Directly Observed Facts\n\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` shows `checkout-web` depends on `payment-api`, and `payment-api` depends on `auth-gateway`.\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` lists recent change `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway` at `2026-03-22T14:05:00Z` with summary `rotated issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows `AUTH-2026-0318` deployed, then a `jwks cache lookup miss`, then `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log` shows `token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway reason=issuer_not_allowed issuer=partner-v2` and then `create_payment rejected ... auth_result=invalid_issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows `submit_order failed status=401 upstream=payment-api` and `payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows concurrent 401 spikes at `14:10:00Z` on `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log` shows `p95_query_ms=35`, `errors=0`, and `no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812`.\n\n## Inferences\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md","text":"# Checkout Incident Triage Notes\n\n## Summary\n\nDependency path from user impact to root cause:\n\n`checkout-web` user submits checkout -> `payment-api` validates payment auth -> `auth-gateway` rejects partner token issuer -> `payment-api` returns 401 -> `checkout-web` checkout flow fails.\n\n## Directly Observed Facts\n\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` shows `checkout-web` depends on `payment-api`, and `payment-api` depends on `auth-gateway`.\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` lists recent change `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway` at `2026-03-22T14:05:00Z` with summary `rotated issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows `AUTH-2026-0318` deployed, then a `jwks cache lookup miss`, then `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log` shows `token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway reason=issuer_not_allowed issuer=partner-v2` and then `create_payment rejected ... auth_result=invalid_issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows `submit_order failed status=401 upstream=payment-api` and `payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows concurrent 401 spikes at `14:10:00Z` on `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log` shows `p95_query_ms=35`, `errors=0`, and `no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812`.\n\n## Inferences\n\n- The primary root cause is `auth-gateway`, not `checkout-web` or `payment-api`, because the downstream services report upstream auth rejection and the first concrete validation failure is logged inside `auth-gateway`.\n- The most likely bad change is `AUTH-2026-0318`, because it immediately precedes the incident window and its stated scope matches the observed issuer/JWKS mismatch.\n- `orders-db` is not the checkout blocker, because the failure occurs before the orders path is reached.\n- `cdn-edge` is not the checkout blocker, because the observed impact is authorization failure during submit, not persistent asset unavailability.\n\n## Root Cause Statement\n\n`auth-gateway` change `AUTH-2026-0318` appears to have rotated the issuer/JWKS namespace to `partner-v2` without updating `allowed_issuers` consistently. That left validation falling back to `partner-v1`, producing `issuer_not_allowed` errors for `partner-v2` tokens and causing `payment-api` and then `checkout-web` to reject checkout requests with 401s.\n\n## Misleading Signals Excluded\n\n- `orders-db` CPU spike: directly observed, but query latency stayed normal and no failing checkout reached the DB.\n- `cdn-edge` image 5xx: directly observed, but isolated to static assets and explicitly not the reason the checkout submit path remained blocked.\n\n## Immediate Mitigation\n\n1. Revert `AUTH-2026-0318`, or restore `auth-gateway` configuration so `allowed_issuers` includes `partner-v2` and matches the active JWKS namespace.\n2. Refresh or clear the JWKS cache after the config rollback/fix to stop fallback to `partner-v1`.\n3. Monitor `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway` for disappearance of `invalid issuer` and `issuer_not_allowed` errors.\n\n## Verification Steps\n\n1. Confirm `auth-gateway` no longer logs `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed` for `partner-v2` tokens.\n2. Confirm `payment-api` stops logging `auth_result=invalid_issuer` and payment creation requests succeed.\n3. Confirm `checkout-web` no longer returns `status=401 upstream=payment-api` for checkout submit requests.\n4. Check that 401 rates in `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` equivalent live dashboards return near baseline for `checkout-web`, `payment-api`, and `auth-gateway`.\n5. Run a partner-token checkout smoke test that exercises the exact dependency chain `checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":47,"totalLines":47,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/out/triage_notes.md","time":{"start":1788193164254,"end":1788193164267}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_074e46425fb7a93f016a95a98c1f5887d299d863e23f9f656b"}},"id":"prt_0589e4bdc001DIEFqktJBK4joz","sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","messageID":"msg_0589e424b001hEWX9JmBD6xm8q"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788193164270,"sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_aBY4ocB6iSrxMzSZw0IZDIP8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"},"output":"<path>/workspace/out/root_cause.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"incident_id\": \"oc-bench-v2-064-checkout-auth-issuer\",\n3:   \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n4:   \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n5:   \"confidence\": 0.97,\n6:   \"affected_services\": [\n7:     \"checkout-web\",\n8:     \"payment-api\",\n9:     \"auth-gateway\"\n10:   ],\n11:   \"evidence\": [\n12:     {\n13:       \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n14:       \"observation\": \"Dependency graph shows checkout-web depends on payment-api, payment-api depends on auth-gateway, and orders-api/orders-db are on a separate branch from payment authorization. Recent change AUTH-2026-0318 was deployed to auth-gateway at 2026-03-22T14:05:00Z.\"\n15:     },\n16:     {\n17:       \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n18:       \"observation\": \"auth-gateway deployed change_id=AUTH-2026-0318, then logged jwks cache miss with fallback to partner-v1 and validation failure reason=issuer_not_allowed for token_issuer=partner-v2 while allowed_issuers remained partner-v1.\"\n19:     },\n20:     {\n21:       \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n22:       \"observation\": \"payment-api logged token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway with issuer_not_allowed and then rejected create_payment for request_id=req-8812 with auth_result=invalid_issuer.\"\n23:     },\n24:     {\n25:       \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n26:       \"observation\": \"checkout-web logged submit_order failed with status=401 from upstream=payment-api and explicitly reported payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer during the blocked checkout flow.\"\n27:     },\n28:     {\n29:       \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n30:       \"observation\": \"At 2026-03-22T14:10:00Z, 401 rates spiked on checkout-web (18.7), payment-api (21.2), and auth-gateway (28.4), while auth-gateway notes mention jwks cache miss and issuer mismatch.\"\n31:     }\n32:   ],\n33:   \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n34:     {\n35:       \"signal\": \"orders-db CPU spike and DB-2026-0144\",\n36:       \"why_not_primary_cause\": \"orders-db metrics show normal query latency and zero errors, and payment-api states the failing requests were rejected before any order-db dependency use. orders-db also logged that no failed checkout transaction for request_id=req-8812 reached the database.\"\n37:     },\n38:     {\n39:       \"signal\": \"cdn-edge static asset 5xx and CDN-2026-0091\",\n40:       \"why_not_primary_cause\": \"The CDN issue is isolated to images in metrics, while checkout-web logged static assets served normally after retry and that the user checkout flow remained blocked by payment auth failures.\"\n41:     }\n42:   ],\n43:   \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n44:     \"Mitigate immediately by reverting AUTH-2026-0318 or restoring auth-gateway allowed_issuers to include partner-v2 and aligning the JWKS namespace with that issuer.\",\n45:     \"Purge or refresh the auth-gateway JWKS cache after the configuration rollback/fix so validation no longer falls back to partner-v1.\",\n46:     \"Verify recovery by confirming issuer_not_allowed errors stop in auth-gateway and payment-api logs and that checkout-web 401 rates return to baseline.\",\n47:     \"Add a deployment guard or config validation that checks issuer and allowed_issuers consistency before auth-gateway releases.\"\n48:   ]\n49: }\n\n(End of file - total 49 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"incident_id\": \"oc-bench-v2-064-checkout-auth-issuer\",\n  \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n  \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.97,\n  \"affected_services\": [\n    \"checkout-web\",\n    \"payment-api\",\n    \"auth-gateway\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"Dependency graph shows checkout-web depends on payment-api, payment-api depends on auth-gateway, and orders-api/orders-db are on a separate branch from payment authorization. Recent change AUTH-2026-0318 was deployed to auth-gateway at 2026-03-22T14:05:00Z.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"auth-gateway deployed change_id=AUTH-2026-0318, then logged jwks cache miss with fallback to partner-v1 and validation failure reason=issuer_not_allowed for token_issuer=partner-v2 while allowed_issuers remained partner-v1.\"\n    },\n    {","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json","text":"{\n  \"incident_id\": \"oc-bench-v2-064-checkout-auth-issuer\",\n  \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n  \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.97,\n  \"affected_services\": [\n    \"checkout-web\",\n    \"payment-api\",\n    \"auth-gateway\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"Dependency graph shows checkout-web depends on payment-api, payment-api depends on auth-gateway, and orders-api/orders-db are on a separate branch from payment authorization. Recent change AUTH-2026-0318 was deployed to auth-gateway at 2026-03-22T14:05:00Z.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"auth-gateway deployed change_id=AUTH-2026-0318, then logged jwks cache miss with fallback to partner-v1 and validation failure reason=issuer_not_allowed for token_issuer=partner-v2 while allowed_issuers remained partner-v1.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"payment-api logged token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway with issuer_not_allowed and then rejected create_payment for request_id=req-8812 with auth_result=invalid_issuer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"checkout-web logged submit_order failed with status=401 from upstream=payment-api and explicitly reported payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer during the blocked checkout flow.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n      \"observation\": \"At 2026-03-22T14:10:00Z, 401 rates spiked on checkout-web (18.7), payment-api (21.2), and auth-gateway (28.4), while auth-gateway notes mention jwks cache miss and issuer mismatch.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"orders-db CPU spike and DB-2026-0144\",\n      \"why_not_primary_cause\": \"orders-db metrics show normal query latency and zero errors, and payment-api states the failing requests were rejected before any order-db dependency use. orders-db also logged that no failed checkout transaction for request_id=req-8812 reached the database.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge static asset 5xx and CDN-2026-0091\",\n      \"why_not_primary_cause\": \"The CDN issue is isolated to images in metrics, while checkout-web logged static assets served normally after retry and that the user checkout flow remained blocked by payment auth failures.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Mitigate immediately by reverting AUTH-2026-0318 or restoring auth-gateway allowed_issuers to include partner-v2 and aligning the JWKS namespace with that issuer.\",\n    \"Purge or refresh the auth-gateway JWKS cache after the configuration rollback/fix so validation no longer falls back to partner-v1.\",\n    \"Verify recovery by confirming issuer_not_allowed errors stop in auth-gateway and payment-api logs and that checkout-web 401 rates return to baseline.\",\n    \"Add a deployment guard or config validation that checks issuer and allowed_issuers consistency before auth-gateway releases.\"\n  ]\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":49,"totalLines":49,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/out/root_cause.json","time":{"start":1788193164250,"end":1788193164269}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_074e46425fb7a93f016a95a98c1f4487d2a185a19fbd645476"}},"id":"prt_0589e4bd7001EdVhe91aKJdcJv","sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","messageID":"msg_0589e424b001hEWX9JmBD6xm8q"}}
