{"type":"text","timestamp":1788193172095,"sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","part":{"id":"prt_0589e62830016Lg1Di8z5ANoSt","messageID":"msg_0589e58d5001AfnT58sHpgohG0","sessionID":"ses_fa762edf7ffe3KEmCj9pF05rYO","type":"text","text":"Created:\n\n- `/workspace/out/root_cause.json`\n- `/workspace/out/triage_notes.md`\n\nConclusion: `auth-gateway` change `AUTH-2026-0318` is the likely root cause. It introduced an issuer/JWKS mismatch that caused `issuer_not_allowed` failures, which propagated through `payment-api` and blocked `checkout-web` checkout submits with 401s.\n\nNote: the host absolute paths you provided were not mounted in this runtime, so I used the mirrored fixture files under `/workspace/in/...` and wrote the outputs under `/workspace/out/...`.","time":{"start":1788193170051,"end":1788193172092},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f6e869e22830297016a95a991ff4887d28a49cd1f781f724c","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
